$ Feature: multidimensional array access m@(i)@(j) (2x2 matrix stored flat)
$ Expected return (x3): 4
$ mat is 2x2: {{1,2},{3,4}}, return mat@(1)@(1) = 4 (if stride correct)
$ If stride is broken, mat@(1)@(1) might = 2 or garbage

fonc [int] main() {
    [int] *mat = {1, 2, 3, 4};
    [int] row = 1;
    [int] col = 1;
    ret mat@(row)@(col);
}
